WEBVTT

30:30.146 --> 30:32.232
- (PEOPLE SHOUTING)
- You stay here. I'll come back.

30:32.357 --> 30:34.651
(BELL RINGING)

30:34.776 --> 30:37.404
(BARKING, PEOPLE SHOUTING)

30:50.333 --> 30:52.460
You're not supposed to be here.

30:52.585 --> 30:55.213
No one is supposed to be here.

30:55.713 --> 30:57.590
It's a mercy.

30:57.715 --> 30:59.551
He's dead already.
